{"id": "DfXOYBqx56D", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Abhimanyu sirf 16 saal kyun jiye? Uski maut janm se pehle tay ho chuki thi, aur shart rakhi thi Chandrama ne. Follow karo.\n\nMahabharat, Adi Parva, adhyay 67. Jab devta dharti par apna ansh bhej rahe the, Chandra ne kaha, main apne putra Varchas ko nahi de sakta, wo mujhe praanon se pyaara hai. Par wo dharti par sirf solah saal rahega.\n\nWahi Varchas, Arjun ka putra Abhimanyu bana. Chandra ne pehle hi bata diya tha: wo Chakravyuh mein ghusega, aadhe din mein shatru sena ka chautha hissa khatam karega, aur shaam tak mere paas laut aayega.\n\nKurukshetra ke terahve din bilkul yahi hua. Aur shart ki aakhri baat: wo ek veer putra chhod jayega. Wahi Parikshit, jiske bina Pandavon ka vansh khatam ho jaata.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Episode 8.\n\n#mahabharata #abhimanyu #chakravyuh #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793888242, "like_count": 6456, "comment_count": 3, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1168516115740735a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.911, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPzl-rrCq9zjlXHmsElgSDEX1XrCYbfhcqr0H3eB5lmfBAjw4rJobRiXOoznrW4oJxcVXZw_Nnlc5WBeVTsdHZapWp4dqC5o26HPTo.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqK90jdjfU9ue4Xxx8pN3tKR17jwfUjo8pFJr0ITYXyxJkKe6pOrmrDnW2w-iZSlk14KZGVUipQRUewYthohY-I&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=v-k9xn1Ek-UQ7kNvwHylA5Z&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=uT71JkmnhS_EEl6qtgu4Sg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_buc